  "goodToKnow": "Ohrfeigen means to slap someone in the face; die Ohrfeige is a slap, figuratively a humiliation: eine Ohrfeige für die Regierung (a slap in the face for the government). Ich könnte mich ohrfeigen! means I could kick myself. In 1968, Beate Klarsfeld famously slapped Chancellor Kiesinger to protest his Nazi past. It's not separable: ohrfeigte, geohrfeigt."
